  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>The finish line is in sight. Make a run for it with the Nike Zoom Vomero 5. Elevating early 2000s running to modern heights, these shoes bring you an outstanding combination of comfort, technology, and innovation you never knew you needed. The breathable and durable materials keep you supported through long runs, while the Zoom Air cushioning ensures a smooth ride. Lace up the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 and bolt past your goals in style.</p> <p><strong>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 </strong><strong>features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Real and synthetic leather upper adds durability and comfort.</li> <li>Mesh panels and ventilation ports on the heel offer breathability and a lightweight fit.</li> <li>Plastic caging on the side enhances support.</li> <li>Rubber outsole ensures traction.</li> </ul></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Grey Fog/Chrome/Metallic Silver</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>IM3486-002</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight: